@startuml sequence-diagram-UC-002
title Sequence UC-002 Subir material — FR-004 / BR-004 v0.4.0 / NFR-005 / RST-005
actor Professor
participant "MaterialsController\n(Adapter)\nFileInterceptor" as Ctrl
participant "UploadMaterialUseCase\n(Controller)" as UC
participant "ValidatorPort\n(Pure Fabrication)" as Val
participant "FileStorage\n(port)" as FS
participant "FileBlob / Material\n(Entities, Creator)" as Ent
participant "FileBlobRepository\n+ MaterialRepository" as Repo
database MariaDB as DB

Professor -> Ctrl : POST /material {file + meta} (JWT Professor/Admin)
note over Ctrl
  NFR-005/BT-11: FileInterceptor corre ANTES del usecase —
  memoryStorage (nada persistido), limits.fileSize=50MB -> 413,
  fileFilter MIME PDF/EPUB -> 415. El borde rechaza primero.
end note
' GRASP Controller — Mission: single entry point per system operation, UI stays thin
Ctrl -> UC : execute(callerId, callerRole, file, meta)
' Paso 2: rol con lo que el caller conoce — Information Expert
' GRASP Information Expert — Mission: co-locate behavior with information (rol del JWT)
UC -> UC : assertCanUpload(callerRole) [403 si Student, FR-003/NFR-006]
' Paso 3: re-validación defensiva ANTES de persistir (NFR-005)
UC -> Val : validateFile(mime, sizeBytes) [413/415]
Val --> UC : ok
UC -> Val : validateMetadata(title/author/…/tags) [400]
Val --> UC : ok
' Paso 4: cada POST crea Material + FileBlob 1:1 nuevos — Creator
' GRASP Creator — Mission: one stable owner per lifecycle, no scattered new
UC -> Val : normalizeFileName(originalName) [basename, sin path/CRLF, NFR-005/BT-10]
Val --> UC : safeName
' GRASP Indirection — Mission: both sides depend on something stable
UC -> FS : store(buffer, safeName) -> storageKey [duplicados -> 201, BR-004]
FS --> UC : storageKey
UC -> Ent : FileBlob.create({storageKey, fileName: safeName, mime, sizeBytes, contentHash})
Ent --> UC : blob
UC -> Repo : FileBlobRepository.save(blob)
Repo -> DB : INSERT file_blobs (RST-004)
Repo --> UC : blob (id)
UC -> Ent : Material.create({meta, ownerId, blobId})
Ent --> UC : material
UC -> Repo : MaterialRepository.save(material)
Repo -> DB : INSERT materials
Repo --> UC : material (id)
alt E-001 fallo tardío al persistir material
  UC -> FS : remove(storageKey) [compensación]
  UC -> Repo : FileBlobRepository.delete(blob.id) [compensación]
  Repo --> UC : ok
  UC --> Ctrl : DomainError INTERNAL -> 500 (nada persistido)
else ok
  UC --> Ctrl : MaterialDTO (sin bytes)
  Ctrl --> Professor : 201 consultable
end

note over Ctrl, UC : Controller solo delega; sin SQL en controllers (RST-004)
@enduml
